 import what is being done outside, and this is why I\\u2019m happy for such a center that will research ageing in the Ghanaian context.\\u201d<\\/i><\\/em><\\/p><p style=\\\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;\\\">Globally, the population of persons above 60 years stood at <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\\\">600 million<\\/strong> a decade ago and is projected to reach <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\\\">2.6 billion by 2050<\\/strong>.<br>In Ghana, with a life expectancy of <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\\\">63 years<\\/strong>, it is estimated that <strong style=\\\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\\\">12% of the population<\\/strong> will be aged 60 or above by 2050 \\u2014 the highest rate in Sub-Saharan Africa.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"entry-footer\\\" style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;align-items:center;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(236, 236, 240);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(56, 56, 56);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:&quot;Nunito Sans&quot;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-top:55px;orphans:2;padding-bottom:20px;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\",\"gallery\":\"[{\\\"img\\\":\\\"news\\/new-hos-474x313.png\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\"}]\",\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"status\":\"published\",\"categories\":[\"21\"],\"image\":\"news\\/new-hos-474x313.png\",\"tag\":\"[{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dr. Rita Larsen Reindorf\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Ghana Health Service\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dr. Phyllis Tawia\\\"}]\",\"allow_comments\":\"1\"}', 'created', 'Mozilla