ransform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">\\u201cHer thoughts were sharp, her words deliberate, and her wisdom profound. She engaged with grace and insight, often offering reflections that lingered long after the conversation ended,\\u201d she recalled.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(56, 56, 56);font-family:&quot;Nunito Sans&quot;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">https:\\/\\/googleads.g.doubleclick.net\\/pagead\\/ads?gdpr=0&amp;client=ca-pub-8129822647069442&amp;output=html&amp;h=280&amp;adk=3343016698&amp;adf=2388624977&amp;w=780&amp;fwrn=4&amp;fwrnh=100&amp;lmt=1761035974&amp;num_ads=1&amp;rafmt=1&amp;armr=3&amp;sem=mc&amp;pwprc=6888529930&amp;ad_type=text_image&amp;format=780\\u00d7280&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fotecfmghana.com%2F2025%2F09%2Fasantehemaa-was-a-radiant-soul-of-wisdom-and-grace-personal-physician-pays-tribute%2F&amp;host=ca-host-pub-2644536267352236&amp;fwr=0&amp;pra=3&amp;rh=195&amp;rw=780&amp;rpe=1&amp;resp_fmts=3&amp;wgl=1&amp;fa=27&amp;uach=WyJtYWNPUyIsIjE1LjYuMSIsImFybSIsIiIsIjE0MS4wLjczOTAuMTA4IixudWxsLDAsbnVsbCwiNjQiLFtbIkdvb2dsZSBDaHJvbWUiLCIxNDEuMC43MzkwLjEwOCJdLFsiTm90P0FfQnJhbmQiLCI4LjAuMC4wIl0sWyJDaHJvbWl1bSIsIjE0MS4wLjczOTAuMTA4Il1dLDBd&amp;abgtt=7&amp;dt=1761035979359&amp;bpp=1&amp;bdt=5473&amp;idt=1&amp;shv=r20251020&amp;mjsv=m202510150101&amp;ptt=9&amp;saldr=aa&amp;abxe=1&amp;cookie_enabled=1&amp;eoidce=1&amp;prev_fmts=0x0%2C1200x280&amp;nras=3&amp;correlator=3449830964729&amp;frm=20&amp;pv=1&amp;u_tz=0&amp;u_his=3&amp;u_h=1080&amp;u_w=1920&amp;u_ah=1055&amp;u_aw=1920&amp;u_cd=24&amp;u_sd=1&amp;dmc=8&amp;adx=3