xcitement was her quiet way of saying goodbye,\\u201d she said, her voice heavy with emotion.<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(56, 56, 56);font-family:&quot;Nunito Sans&quot;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Remembering the Queen Mother\\u2019s legacy, she concluded, \\u201cNana leaves behind a legacy of resilience, intellect, and unconditional love. Her memory will continue to guide us, reminding us to live with purpose, to honour others with respect, and to cherish the bonds that make us family.\\u201d<\\/p><p style=\\\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(56, 56, 56);font-family:&quot;Nunito Sans&quot;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\\\">Source: Ghana\\/otecfmghana.com\\/Francis Appiah<\\/p>\",\"gallery\":null,\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"status\":\"published\",\"categories\":[\"21\"],\"image\":\"news\\/4085fe3a-0caa-48bf-b37d-15646d556236-1-474x313.jpg\",\"tag\":\"[{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Asantehene\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Asantehemaa\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Dr. Nana Akosua Akyaa Adutwumwaa\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"physician\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"Queen Mother\\\"}]\",\"allow_comments\":\"1\",\"submitter\":