42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":403,\\\"key\\\":\\\"obstetrics-gynaecology\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":3,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":4,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/care-of-older-adults\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":null,\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Care of Older Adults\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":null,\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":4,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Care of Older Adults\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Specialized geriatric care focusing on the unique health needs of elderly patients.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Geriatric Care Services<\\/h3><p>Our Care of Older Adults department specializes in the comprehensive healthcare needs of elderly patients.<\\/p><h4>Services Provided:<\\/h4><ul><li>Comprehensive geriatric assessments<\\/li><li>Management of multiple chronic conditions<\\/li><li>Medication management and review<\\/li><li>Fall prevention and mobility assessment<\\/li><li>Cognitive assessment and dementia care<\\/li><li>Nutritional counseling<\\/li><li>Palliative and end-of-life care<\\/li><li>Coordination with family and caregivers<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/geriatric-care.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":404,\\\"key\\\":\\\"care-of-older-adults\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":4,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":11,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":5,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/neurosurgery\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":null,\\\"position\\\":4,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Neurosurgery\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":null,\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":5,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Neurosurgery\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Advanced surgical treatment for conditions affecting the brain, spine, and nervous system.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Neurosurgery Department<\\/h3><p>Our Neurosurgery department provides advanced surgical care for conditions affecting the brain, spinal cord, and peripheral nervous system.<\\/p><h4>Neurosurgical Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Brain tumor surgery<\\/li><li>Spinal surgery (disc herniation, spinal stenosis)<\\/li><li>Cerebrovascular surgery (aneurysms, AVMs)<\\/li><li>Trauma surgery (head and spinal injuries)<\\/li><li>Peripheral nerve surgery<\\/li><li>Hydrocephalus treatment<\\/li><li>Minimally invasive neurosurgery<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/neurosurgery.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":405,\\\"key\\\":\\\"neurosurgery\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":5,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":12,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/paediatrics\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":null,\\\"position\\\":5,\\\"ti