ulder)<\\/li><li>Sports injury treatment<\\/li><li>Arthritis management<\\/li><li>Spine surgery<\\/li><li>Hand and foot surgery<\\/li><li>Arthroscopic surgery<\\/li><li>Pediatric orthopaedics<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/orthopaedics.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":408,\\\"key\\\":\\\"orthopaedics\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":8,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":15,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":9,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/ent-care\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":null,\\\"position\\\":8,\\\"title\\\":\\\"ENT Care\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":null,\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":9,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Ear, Nose, and Throat (ENT) Care\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Comprehensive treatment for conditions affecting the ears, nose, throat, and related structures.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>ENT (Otolaryngology) Services<\\/h3><p>Our ENT department provides comprehensive care for conditions affecting the ears, nose, throat, and related structures.<\\/p><h4>ENT Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Hearing evaluation and treatment<\\/li><li>Ear infections and disorders<\\/li><li>Sinus problems and sinusitis treatment<\\/li><li>Nasal and sinus surgery<\\/li><li>Throat disorders and voice problems<\\/li><li>Tonsil and adenoid surgery<\\/li><li>Sleep apnea treatment<\\/li><li>Head and neck cancer treatment<\\/li><li>Allergy testing and treatment<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"se