ription\\\":\\\"Specialized care for urinary tract and male reproductive system conditions.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Urology Services<\\/h3><p>Our Urology department provides comprehensive diagnosis and treatment for conditions affecting the urinary tract.<\\/p><h4>Urological Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Kidney stone treatment<\\/li><li>Urinary tract infection management<\\/li><li>Prostate disease treatment (BPH, prostate cancer)<\\/li><li>Bladder conditions and incontinence<\\/li><li>Male infertility evaluation<\\/li><li>Erectile dysfunction treatment<\\/li><li>Urological cancer treatment<\\/li><li>Minimally invasive urological surgery<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/urology.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":407,\\\"key\\\":\\\"urology\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":7,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":14,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":8,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/orthopaedics\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":7,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Orthopaedics\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":8,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Orthopaedics\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Expert care for musculoskeletal conditions including bones, joints, and soft tissues.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Orthopaedic Services<\\/h3><p>Our Orthopaedics department specializes in the diagnosis, treatment, and rehabilitation of musculoskeletal conditions.<\\/p><h4>Orthopaedic Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Fracture treatment and trauma care<\\/li><li>Joint replacement surgery (hip, knee, shoulder)<\\/li><li>Sports injury treatment<\\/li><li>Arthritis management<\\/li><li>Spine surgery<\\/li><li>Hand and foot surgery<\\/li><li>Arthroscopic surgery<\\/li><li>Pediatric orthopaedics<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/orthopaedics.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":408,\\\"key\\\":\\\"orthopaedics\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":8,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":15,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":9,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/ent-care\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":8,\\\"title\\\":\\\"ENT Care\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":9,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Ear, Nose, and Throat (ENT) Care\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Comprehensive treatment for conditions affecting the ears, nose, throat, and related structures.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>ENT (Otolaryngology) Services<\\/h3><p>Our ENT department provides comprehensive care for conditions affecting the ears, nose, throat, and related structures.<\\/p><h4>ENT Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Hearing evaluation and treatment<\\/li><li>Ear infections and disorders<\\/li><li>Sinus problems and sinusitis treatment<\\/li><li>Nasal and sinus surgery<\\/li><li>Throat disorders and voice problems<\\/li><li>Tonsil and adenoid surgery<\\/li><li>Sleep apnea treatment<\\/li><li>Head and neck cancer treatment<\\/li><li>Allergy testing and treatment<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/ent-care.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":409,\\\"key\\\":\\\"ent-care\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":9,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":16,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":10,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/eye-care\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":9,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Eye Care\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Eye Care\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Comprehensive ophthalmology services for vision and eye health.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Ophthalmology Services<\\/h3><p>Our Eye Care department provides comprehensive ophthalmology services to protect and preserve your vision.<\\/p><h4>Eye Care Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Comprehensive eye examinations<\\/li><li>Cataract surgery<\\/li><li>Glaucoma diagnosis and treatment<\\/li><li>Diabetic eye disease management<\\/li><li>Retinal disorders treatment<\\/li><li>Refractive surgery (LASIK)<\\/li><li>Pediatric ophthalmology<\\/li><li>Emergency eye care<\\/li><li>Contact lens fitting<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/eyecare-1.png\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-05T11:10:05.000000Z\\\",\\\"slug