tation with one of our general practitioners.<\\/p>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/general-practice.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":401,\\\"key\\\":\\\"general-practice\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":1,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":8,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":2,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/general-surgery\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"title\\\":\\\"General Surgery\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":2,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"General Surgery\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Expert surgical care for a wide range of conditions requiring operative treatment.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>General Surgery Department<\\/h3><p>Our General Surgery department offers comprehensive surgical services using the latest techniques and technology.<\\/p><h4>Surgical Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Abdominal surgery (appendectomy, hernia repair)<\\/li><li>Gastrointestinal surgery<\\/li><li>Thyroid and endocrine surgery<\\/li><li>Breast surgery<\\/li><li>Soft tissue surgery<\\/li><li>Emergency surgical procedures<\\/li><li>Minimally invasive laparoscopic surgery<\\/li><\\/ul><h4>Our Approach<\\/h4><p>We prioritize patient safety and comfort, utilizing modern surgical techniques to minimize recovery time and optimize outcomes.<\\/p>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/general-surgery.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\