<\\/li><li>Allergy testing and treatment<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/ent-care.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":409,\\\"key\\\":\\\"ent-care\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":9,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":16,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":10,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/eye-care\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":9,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Eye Care\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Eye Care\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Comprehensive ophthalmology services for vision and eye health.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Ophthalmology Services<\\/h3><p>Our Eye Care department provides comprehensive ophthalmology services to protect and preserve your vision.<\\/p><h4>Eye Care Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Comprehensive eye examinations<\\/li><li>Cataract surgery<\\/li><li>Glaucoma diagnosis and treatment<\\/li><li>Diabetic eye disease management<\\/li><li>Retinal disorders treatment<\\/li><li>Refractive surgery (LASIK)<\\/li><li>Pediatric ophthalmology<\\/li><li>Emergency eye care<\\/li><li>Contact lens fitting<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/eyecare-1.png\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-05T11:10:05.000000Z\\\",\\\"slug