ription\\\":\\\"Specialized care for urinary tract and male reproductive system conditions.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Urology Services<\\/h3><p>Our Urology department provides comprehensive diagnosis and treatment for conditions affecting the urinary tract.<\\/p><h4>Urological Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Kidney stone treatment<\\/li><li>Urinary tract infection management<\\/li><li>Prostate disease treatment (BPH, prostate cancer)<\\/li><li>Bladder conditions and incontinence<\\/li><li>Male infertility evaluation<\\/li><li>Erectile dysfunction treatment<\\/li><li>Urological cancer treatment<\\/li><li>Minimally invasive urological surgery<\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/urology.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":407,\\\"key\\\":\\\"urology\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":7,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":14,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":8,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/orthopaedics\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":7,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Orthopaedics\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":8,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Orthopaedics\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Expert care for musculoskeletal conditions including bones, joints, and soft tissues.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Orthopaedic Services<\\/h3><p>Our Orthopaedics department specializes in the diagnosis, treatment, and rehabilitation of musculoskeletal conditions.<\\/p><h4>Orthopaedic Services:<\\/h