d neurological disorder treatment.\\\\\\\" icon_3=\\\\\\\"ti ti-brain\\\\\\\" title_4=\\\\\\\"Orthopaedics\\\\\\\" description_4=\\\\\\\"Bone, joint, and muscle care including fracture treatment, joint replacement, and sports injury management.\\\\\\\" icon_4=\\\\\\\"ti ti-bone\\\\\\\" title_5=\\\\\\\"Obstetrics & Gynaecology\\\\\\\" description_5=\\\\\\\"Complete women\'s health services including prenatal care, delivery, family planning, and gynaecological procedures.\\\\\\\" icon_5=\\\\\\\"ti ti-baby-carriage\\\\\\\" title_6=\\\\\\\"Paediatrics\\\\\\\" description_6=\\\\\\\"Comprehensive child healthcare from newborn to adolescent including vaccinations, growth monitoring, and pediatric treatments.\\\\\\\" icon_6=\\\\\\\"ti ti-baby-bottle\\\\\\\" title_7=\\\\\\\"Internal Medicine\\\\\\\" description_7=\\\\\\\"Diagnosis and treatment of adult diseases including diabetes, hypertension, respiratory conditions, and chronic illnesses.\\\\\\\" icon_7=\\\\\\\"ti ti-stethoscope\\\\\\\" title_8=\\\\\\\"Emergency Services\\\\\\\" description_8=\\\\\\\"24\\/7 emergency care with rapid response teams, trauma care, and advanced life support systems.\\\\\\\" icon_8=\\\\\\\"ti ti-ambulance\\\\\\\" background_color=\\\\\\\"rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\\\\\" enable_lazy_loading=\\\\\\\"yes\\\\\\\"][\\/content-feature-list]\\\\n\\\\n[counter style=\\\\\\\"style-2\\\\\\\" title=\\\\\\\"Service Excellence\\\\\\\" subtitle=\\\\\\\"OUR COMMITMENT\\\\\\\" description=\\\\\\\"Delivering quality healthcare across all specialties.\\\\\\\" quantity=\\\\\\\"4\\\\\\\" title_1=\\\\\\\"Medical Specialties\\\\\\\" number_1=\\\\\\\"15\\\\\\\" unit_1=\\\\\\\"+\\\\\\\" title_2=\\\\\\\"Experienced Doctors\\\\\\\" number_2=\\\\\\\"50\\\\\\\" unit_2=\\\\\\\"+\\\\\\\" title_3=\\\\\\\"Successful Procedures\\\\\\\" number_3=\\\\\\\"10000\\\\\\\" unit_3=\\\\\\\"+\\\\\\\" title_4=\\\\\\\"Patient Satisfaction\\\\\\\" number_4=\\\\\\\"98\\\\\\\" unit_4=\\\\\\\"%\\\\\\\" background_color=\\\\\\\"rgb(20, 23, 108)\\\\