\/h4><ul><li>Abdominal surgery (appendectomy, hernia repair)<\\/li><li>Gastrointestinal surgery<\\/li><li>Thyroid and endocrine surgery<\\/li><li>Breast surgery<\\/li><li>Soft tissue surgery<\\/li><li>Emergency surgical procedures<\\/li><li>Minimally invasive laparoscopic surgery<\\/li><\\/ul><h4>Our Approach<\\/h4><p>We prioritize patient safety and comfort, utilizing modern surgical techniques to minimize recovery time and optimize outcomes.<\\/p>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/generalsurgery-910x545-1.jpg\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-06T03:49:57.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":402,\\\"key\\\":\\\"general-surgery\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":2,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":9,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":3,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/obstetrics-gynaecology\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Obstetrics & Gynaecology\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":3,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Obstetrics & Gynaecology\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Comprehensive women\'s health services including prenatal care, delivery, and gynecological treatments.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Obstetrics &amp; Gynaecology Services<\\/h3><p>Our Obstetrics and Gynaecology department provides comprehensive healthcare services for women at all stages of life.<\\/p><h4>Obstetric Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Prenatal care and monitoring<\\/li><li>High-risk pregnancy management<\\/li><li>Normal and cesarean deliveries<\\/li><li>Ultrasound and fetal monitoring<\\/li><li>Postnatal care<\\/li><li>Family planning counseling<\\/li><\\/ul><h4>Gynaecological Services:<\\/h4><ul><li>Annual well-woman examinations<\\/li><li>Contraception and family planning<\\/li><li>Menstrual disorder management<\\/li><li>Menopause management<\\/li><li>Gynecological surgery<\\/li><li><p>Infertility evaluation and treatment<\\/p><p>Book this service now: <a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\/\\/book.carepatron.com\\/Metro-Health-Hospital?p=zqhaW0RLTFCuEJAX29.7zQ&amp;i=yUdE--lj\\\\\\\">Book An Appointment<\\/a><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/patient-with-pregnancy-talking-physician-about-medical-care-482257-27155.avif\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-08T07:24:38.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":403,\\\"key\\\":\\\"obstetrics-gynaecology\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":3,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":4,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/care-of-older-adults\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Care of Older Adults\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":4,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Care of Older Adults\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Specialized geriatric care focusing on the unique health needs of elderly patients.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Geriatric Care Services<\\/h3><p>Our Care of Older Adults department specializes in the comprehensive healthcare needs of elderly patients.<\\/p><h4>Services Provided:<\\/h4><ul><li>Comprehensive geriatric assessments<\\/li><li>Management of multiple chronic conditions<\\/li><li>Medication management and review<\\/li><li>Fall prevention and mobility assessment<\\/li><li>Cognitive assessment and dementia care<\\/li><li>Nutritional counseling<\\/li><li>Palliative and end-of-life care<\\/li><li>Coordination with family and caregivers<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Book this service now: <a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\/\\/book.carepatron.com\\/Metro-Health-Hospital?p=zqhaW0RLTFCuEJAX29.7zQ&amp;i=kct1ttYV\\\\\\\">Book An Appointment<\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/prmi-1-1.png\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-08T07:43:11.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":404,\\\"key\\\":\\\"care-of-older-adults\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":4,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":11,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":5,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/neurosurgery\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":4,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Neurosurgery\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":5,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Neurosurgery\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Advanced neurological and neurosurgical care for brain, spine, and nervous system disorders including stroke, epilepsy, brain tumors, movement disorders, and 24\\/7 emergency services.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Neurology & Neurosurgery at Metro Health Hospital<\\/h3><p>Neurology deals with disorders related to the brain, spine, nerves, and muscles. In recent years, neurological problems have become increasingly common, affecting people of all age groups. Some of the most prevalent neurological disorders include Stroke, Epilepsy, Brain Infections, Parkinson\'s Disease or other Movement Disorders, Autoimmune conditions including Multiple Sclerosis, Neuropathy, and Dementia. These conditions require early diagnosis and advanced treatment to ensure better patient outcomes.<\\/p><h4>Collaborative Multidisciplinary Care<\\/h4><p>The Neurology Department at Metro Health Hospital collaborates seamlessly with other specialties, including:<\\/p><ul><li>Neurosurgery<\\/li><li>Critical Care<\\/li><li>Neurointerventional Radiology<\\/li><li>Neurophysiology<\\/li><li>Neuro-oncology (Medical and Radiation)<\\/li><\\/ul><h4>Advanced Diagnostic Technology<\\/h4><p>At Metro Health Hospital, the Department of Neurology offers comprehensive care for all these disorders using the latest medical technologies. The hospital is equipped with state-of-the-art MRI and CT scan machines for precise diagnosis, ensuring accurate detection of neurological issues. Additionally, Metro Health Hospital has a highly advanced Neurophysiology Department, providing essential diagnostic tests such as:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>EEG (Electroencephalogram)<\\/strong> - Brain activity monitoring<\\/li><li><strong>NCV (Nerve Conduction Velocity)<\\/strong> - Nerve function assessment<\\/li><li><strong>EMG (Electromyography)<\\/strong> - Muscle electrical activity testing<\\/li><li><strong>RNS (Repetitive Nerve Stimulation)<\\/strong> - Neuromuscular junction evaluation<\\/li><li><strong>EP (Evoked Potentials)<\\/strong> - Sensory pathway testing<\\/li><\\/ul><p>These tests help in assessing brain, nerve and muscle functions, leading to more effective treatments.<\\/p><h4>24\\/7 Emergency Neurological Services<\\/h4><p>Recognizing the urgency of neurological emergencies, Metro Health Hospital offers 24\\/7 emergency services for conditions like stroke, seizures, and other critical neurological disorders. With cutting-edge technology, the hospital ensures that patients receive timely and world-class care. For those seeking expert neurological care, Metro Health Hospital stands as a trusted centre for excellence, providing advanced diagnosis, treatment, and emergency services round the clock.<\\/p><h4>Specialized Neurological Care<\\/h4><p>Metro Health Hospital, Kumasi, offers state-of-the-art diagnosis and treatment for various neurological conditions, including:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Stroke and Acute Neurological Emergencies<\\/strong> - Rapid response and intervention<\\/li><li><strong>Head and Spinal Injuries<\\/strong> - Comprehensive trauma care<\\/li><li><strong>Brain Tumors<\\/strong> - Advanced surgical and medical management<\\/li><li><strong>Seizure Disorders and Epilepsy<\\/strong> - Specialized epilepsy care and management<\\/li><li><strong>Movement Disorders<\\/strong> - Including Parkinson\'s disease treatment<\\/li><li><strong>Neuromuscular Disorders<\\/strong> - Comprehensive diagnosis and therapy<\\/li><li><strong>Headaches and Migraines<\\/strong> - Specialized headache clinic<\\/li><li><strong>Pediatric Neurological Conditions<\\/strong> - Expert care for children<\\/li><\\/ul><h4>Neuro Interventional Excellence<\\/h4><p>The hospital\'s neuro interventional team is equipped to handle acute stroke cases, offering rapid diagnosis and treatment to minimize complications. Our advanced facilities and experienced specialists ensure that every patient receives the highest standard of neurological care.<\\/p><p>Trust Metro Health Hospital for comprehensive neurological and neurosurgical care with cutting-edge technology and compassionate expertise.<\\/p>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/wee-1.png\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-05T19:37:49.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":405,\\\"key\\\":\\\"neurosurgery\\\",\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"reference_id\\\":5,\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"services\\\"}}}},{\\\"menuItem\\\":{\\\"id\\\":12,\\\"menu_id\\\":1,\\\"parent_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_id\\\":6,\\\"reference_type\\\":\\\"Botble\\\\\\\\Portfolio\\\\\\\\Models\\\\\\\\Service\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"\\/services\\/paediatrics\\\",\\\"icon_font\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"position\\\":5,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Paediatrics\\\",\\\"css_class\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_self\\\",\\\"has_child\\\":0,\\\"icon_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":[],\\\"reference\\\":{\\\"id\\\":6,\\\"category_id\\\":5,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Paediatrics\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Specialized medical care for infants, children, and adolescents.\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<h3>Paediatric Services<\\/h3><p>Our Paediatrics department provides comprehensive healthcare services for children from birth through adolescence.<\\/p><h4>Services Include:<\\/h4><ul><li>Well-child check-ups and developmental assessments<\\/li><li>Childhood vaccinations and immunizations<\\/li><li>Treatment of acute and chronic childhood illnesses<\\/li><li>Growth and nutrition counseling<\\/li><li>Behavioral and developmental support<\\/li><li>Asthma and allergy management<\\/li><li>Adolescent health services<\\/li><li><p>Newborn care<\\/p><p>Book this service now: <a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\/\\/book.carepatron.com\\/Metro-Health-Hospital?p=zqhaW0RLTFCuEJAX29.7zQ&amp;i=R85SEQ5i\\\\\\\">Book An Appointment<\\/a><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\\\",\\\"is_featured\\\":true,\\\"image\\\":\\\"services\\/1.webp\\\",\\\"images\\\":[],\\\"views\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":{\\\"value\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Published\\\"},\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-04T17:54:42.000000Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-01-08T07:31:16.000000Z\\\",\\\"slugable\\\":{\\\"id\\\":406,\\\"key\\\":\\\"paediatrics\\\",\\\"reference_type\